---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About — RigPure"
  description="RigPure is an independent PC gaming site: hands-on reviews, practical guides and fast, factual news. No pay-for-play, no filler."
  active="about"
>
  <div class="article-wrap"><div class="container">
    <article class="prose" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto">
      <h1>About RigPure</h1>
      <p class="dek">RigPure covers PC gaming the way we'd want it covered: reviews from people who actually finished the game, guides that get to the point, and news without the hype.</p>

      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p>We publish three kinds of content, and we don't pad any of them:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Reviews</strong> — a verdict, a score, and honest pros and cons, written after real playtime.</li>
        <li><strong>Guides</strong> — practical, actionable answers for progression, builds and getting started, without the filler.</li>
        <li><strong>News</strong> — announcements, updates and events, reported fast and kept factual.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Every game we cover also gets its own profile page in <a href="/games">Games</a>, so you can see everything we've written about a title in one place.</p>

      <div class="callout tip">
        <span class="c-label">Editorial standard</span>
        <p>If we haven't played it, we don't review it. If a number in a guide isn't verifiable, we say so instead of guessing.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
      <div class="author-box">
        <div class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">A</div>
        <div>
          <div class="a-name">Alex <svg class="verified" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-label="Verified author"><path d="M12 2l2.4 1.8 3 .1 1 2.8 2.4 1.8-.9 2.9.9 2.9-2.4 1.8-1 2.8-3 .1L12 22l-2.4-1.8-3-.1-1-2.8L3.2 15.5l.9-2.9-.9-2.9 2.4-1.8 1-2.8 3-.1z"/><path d="M9.5 12.5l1.8 1.8 3.5-3.8" stroke="#07080b" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
          <div class="a-role">Editor</div>
          <p class="a-bio">PC gaming reviewer — plays and tests every title covered before writing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>Independence</h2>
      <p>RigPure is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of the publishers or developers we cover. The site is funded by display advertising and, on some pages, affiliate links — clearly identified where they appear. Neither influences what we say about a game. See our <a href="/legal-notice">Legal notice</a> for the details.</p>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>Spotted an error, have a tip, or want to talk partnerships? Head over to <a href="/contact">Contact</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </div></div>
</BaseLayout>
